# Module: Institution Management

## Scope

Tenant provisioning, academic years/terms, grades, classes, sections, subjects, staff profiles.

## Key Entities

`Tenant`, `TenantSettings`, `AcademicYear`, `Term`, `Grade`, `Class`, `Section`, `Subject`, `ClassSubject`, `Staff`

## Permissions

```
institution.tenant.create        # super-admin only
institution.tenant.manage
institution.academic-years.manage
institution.classes.manage
institution.subjects.manage
institution.staff.manage
```

## Commands (MVP)

| Implemented | Path |
|-------------|------|
| `CreateTenantCommand` | `Application/Commands/Tenants/CreateTenant/` |

- `SuspendTenantCommand`, `ActivateTenantCommand` (not yet)
- `CreateAcademicYearCommand`, `SetCurrentAcademicYearCommand`
- `CreateGradeCommand`, `CreateClassCommand`, `CreateSectionCommand`
- `AssignClassTeacherCommand`, `CreateSubjectCommand`, `AssignSubjectToClassCommand`
- `CreateStaffCommand`, `LinkStaffToUserCommand`

## Validation Rules

- Academic year dates must not overlap within tenant
- Only one `IsCurrent = true` academic year per tenant
- Class capacity must be positive integer
- Class teacher must be active staff in same tenant

## Events

- `TenantCreatedIntegrationEvent` → seed defaults (roles, CoA stub)
- `AcademicYearChangedIntegrationEvent`

## Hierarchy

```
Tenant → AcademicYear → Grade → Class → Section
                              ↘ Subject (via ClassSubject)
```

## Dependencies

- Identity module for `User` linking on staff
- RBAC for tenant admin role seeding on provisioning
